<title>FRANCE: Jospin would consult Fr Telecom staff on sale.</title>
<headline>Jospin would consult Fr Telecom staff on sale.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>French Socialist party leader Lionel Jospin would consult the employees of telecommunications operator France Telecom on any partial privatisation, newspaper Le Monde reported on Tuesday.</p>
</text>
